  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MultiDonor Trust Fund for the Global Financing Facility (GFF) in Support of Every Woman Every Child</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The overarching development objective of the TF is improved outcomes  for MDGs 4 &amp; 5, namely Reduction of Infant Mortality and Improvement  of Maternal Health. The TF supports progress towards this objective  thru the piloting of an
 innovative financing mechanism in 4-6 countries. The results of this  pilot, along with the knowledge generated on good design and  implementation strategies for this mechanism, will provide a platform  for scaling up this kind of financing as an option for future funding  in this area. It is expected that the mechanism, if shown to be  successful, will attract other development partners&apos; contributions and  allow them to be channeled in a harmonized way at the country level.  The goals of the TF are to:
 (1) improve MDG4 and 5 results in 4-6 pilot countries through  application of results-based financing(RBF) mechanism;(2) help assure  sustained financing in these pilot countries; (3) generate new  knowledge about effective design and implementation strategies for  successful RBF interventions; and 4) develop a credible and viable  platform for scaling up
 RBF through an IDA-friendly mechanism.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
